@PulseOps.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5187

### Register a user and their organization
POST {{PulseOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "change-me-123",
  "organizationName": "Example Org"
}

### Log in and copy the token from the response
POST {{PulseOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "password": "change-me-123"
}

### Register a service to monitor
@token = paste-the-token-here
POST {{PulseOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "GitHub",
  "url": "https://github.com",
  "checkIntervalSeconds": 60
}

### List your organization's services with their latest check
GET {{PulseOps.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
